* A macro argument that is a mnemonic with a size keeps its dot.
* fixed: 8266699 2026-10-09 r68togas: no sys.l folding for a sum with the source's own constants; mnemonic macro arguments
* expect text: 4a00 4a90
 psect mnemonic_arg,0,0,0,0,0
MNEM macro
 \1 \2
 endm
 MNEM tst.b,d0
 MNEM tst.l,(a0)
 ends
